    {
      "doc": "The host's own status, as the CBOR, JSON and text view of its calls. The calls themselves, with their arguments and C\nsignatures, are the members of the host table (`xip_host` in `include/xip.h`, documented in `crates/xip-abi/src/host.rs`);\nhere are the maps they return. Method numbers are the slots of the host table. Wi-Fi is in `wifi.API.md`.",
      "index": 0,
      "name": "host"
    }
  ],
  "format": "mesh-api/1",
